{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">想在家中煮出鮮味十足的魚料理？肥媽在節目《今個夏天食平D》中，為大家示範了一道「雪菜黃魚」。這道菜式不僅完美融合了黃花魚的鮮甜與雪菜的獨特鹹香，更特別加入了粉絲，讓粉絲吸盡魚汁精華，味道層次極為豐富，絕對令人一試難忘！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"f8dcecf0-0c50-4898-8e2c-126e827a0d3b.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026S2dFNWGxfZ1787045780.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"f8dcecf0-0c50-4898-8e2c-126e827a0d3b.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">準備食材</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">黃花魚</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">雪菜</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">粉絲</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">蔬菜上湯（或雞湯）</p></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">烹調做法</p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"55d9bc8d-c997-4dd2-91f8-462f2c7948e5.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026QI6brCAeU51787045780.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"55d9bc8d-c997-4dd2-91f8-462f2c7948e5.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"6b0a2af0-04bb-49b1-9516-d737198b4cf6.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026xgYTkbDG3l1787045780.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"6b0a2af0-04bb-49b1-9516-d737198b4cf6.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">入廚小貼士</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><blockquote><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></blockquote></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-26T09:59:01.388916+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}